51
00:02:40,393 --> 00:02:41,233
о-о-о-о-о

52
00:02:41,413 --> 00:02:45,213
Someday you’ll grow up, become big and real,

53
00:02:45,313 --> 00:02:47,653
With serious plans and real life to deal.

54
00:02:47,673 --> 00:02:50,154
You’ll see how cool those simple days had been -

55
00:02:50,294 --> 00:02:52,254
Games, memes, tea, and lights within.

56
00:02:52,314 --> 00:02:54,674
But today just chill, don’t overthink, don’t fight,

57
00:02:54,694 --> 00:02:57,194
Let the house be loud, let Wi-Fi shine bright.

58
00:02:57,294 --> 00:02:59,334
Our Talyan - funny, real, and true,

59
00:02:59,614 --> 00:03:01,755
Kind, smart, a little lost too.

60
00:03:04,555 --> 00:03:07,895
Thirteen candles… monitor still on,

61
00:03:09,195 --> 00:03:12,555
Discord is buzzing till the night is gone.

62
00:03:12,995 --> 00:03:17,636
Tolik smiles: “Alright… I’m in the game”,

63
00:03:17,656 --> 00:03:27,837
Happy birthday, Toly… stay just the same.

